  "description": "Retrieval evaluation queries for an autonomous SEO agent over the Alpinaria OKF bundle (+ shared playbook). Graded relevance: 2 = must appear, 1 = acceptable. 'distractors' are near-duplicates that should rank BELOW the grade-2 concept (stale snapshot, wrong intent, wrong language, deprecated page).",
